v1.0.2 (current)
-----------------------------------

- Lowered the win condition from 30 cherub souls to 20.

- Fixed potential player lockout from the top platform.
- adjusted map platform spacing.

- Fixed bug where enemies stopped spawning before the player reached 30 kills.

- Fixed potion drinking sound effect.

v1.0.1
-----------------------------------

- Fixed critical bug where the game would freeze if the player cycled through the dialogue boxes.

- Fixed bug where the QUIT option in the pause menu did not do anything. It now brings the player
to the main menu.

- The game now displays a clear objective in the hud at the top of the screen